  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NativeAOT support: AOT analyzers on net8.0+, reflection-free driver factory registration, AotSmoke across Windows/Linux/macOS; 31-language runtime localization covering driver metadata, parameter descriptions, exception messages and log templates; new serial-port and Modbus factory injection for board drivers; fixed float/double and point byte-order conversion on big-endian hosts; 424 unit tests pass.  NativeAOT 支持：net8.0+ 启用 AOT 分析器，驱动工厂免反射注册，AotSmoke 覆盖 Windows/Linux/macOS；31 种语言运行时本地化，覆盖驱动元数据、参数描述、异常消息与日志模板；新增板卡串口与 Modbus 工厂注入；修复大端主机浮点与点位字节序转换；424 项单元测试全部通过。",
